Babies are always picking up new habits. We are giving your children the opportunity to learn and play with a cute little baby panda. Let babies know that their actions are normal and all the other babies do them, too!
Fun features:
- Learn baby habits;
- Interact with Kiki, our little panda;
- Build new vocabulary! Learning words! 
Let your babies meet their digital peers. They can be more open about the things they do and the thing they would like to do. Maybe they will pick up some of the positive habits along the way! It is time for babies to play and see! Join the fun for free!

